# Unified paper-trading runtime dependencies, isolated from the weather/API stack.
#
# LumiBot is GPL-3.0. It is consumed as an unmodified, unvendored dependency and
# the current use is private/internal. Review the GPL implications before
# distributing any LumiBot-combined work.
#
# LumiBot is a strategy/backtest framework here, not an execution path: orders
# route through PaperExecutionService and the deterministic risk gate. No broker
# is constructed at import time and no credentials are required.
#
# Compile with:
#   env -u PYTHONPATH "$ENVS/unified-trading-py311/bin/pip-compile" \
#       requirements-trading.in --output-file requirements-trading.txt
lumibot
